    "sub_name": "經營管理模式與策略研討",
    "sub_ename": "SEMINAR ON BUSINESS MANAGEMENT MODELS AND STRATEGIES",
    "describe_ch": "本課程以逢甲大學EMBA課程設計專屬的SCOPAB六大元素為架構，內容涵蓋策略與定位（Strategy & Positioning）、成本與財務（Cost ＆ Finance）、組織（Organization）、流程（Process）、人文/美學（Humanism ＆ Aesthetics）與品牌經營（Branding），讓學生可以擴展管理格局及決策廣度。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is based on the six elements of SCOPAB exclusively designed for the EMBA course design of Feng Chia University. It includes: Strategy & Positioning, Cost & Finance, Organization, Process, and Humanities/Aesthetics and Branding, allowing students to expand the management structure and decision-making.",
    "pre_subname": "",
